<span class="material-symbols-outlined">more_horiz</span>
</button>
</div>
<div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#111418] p-2 rounded border border-dashed border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] align-middle mr-1">info</span>
                    Paused by user request due to high API latency.
