</div>
<div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#111418] rounded p-3 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-mono border-l-2 border-green-500">
<p>All systems operational. No flags raised.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
<!-- Floating Action Button -->
<div class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-30">
<button class="group flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-primary text-white shadow-lg shadow-primary/40 hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
